                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJf5b9IeOvQjQRXyHwj63mp6A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dE5EVjRjbHA0UkVKNWQzSjJiMHBzU2tzMlJFRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  1,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The decorative lights used by the restaurant were covered in dust.\n\nSome people complained about the long wait times. We entered the restaurant at 7:30 PM, and everyone else seemed to be almost full, but we still waited a long time. We asked and reminded the staff 2-3 times (\"Is our food ready?\"), and the staff initially said it was being prepared, but later gave somewhat impatient replies... The pasta took about 10 minutes, which was understandable, but the mini hot pot took almost 20 minutes to arrive. Were they \"cooking the broth\" on the spot? The stir-fried mushroom pasta cost NT$180.\n\nThe Korean kimchi hot pot cost NT$320. The taste was average; it had pork slices, but most of the ingredients were hot pot ingredients (fish cakes, crab sticks, all starchy products), and it only came with a bowl of white rice. That was it.\n\nThe only advantage is the convenient location; it\u0027s very close to the Fuxinggang MRT station, just to the right of the exit.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "店家使用的造型燈上堆滿灰塵。\n有人反映等餐時間過長，我們 7:30 進餐廳，看大家都快吃飽了，我們也等了很久。詢問與提醒店家了2~3次(請問我們的餐作好了嗎?)，初次詢問表示在做了，之後有點不耐煩的回答......。義大利麵等了約 10 分鐘，還能理解，但小火鍋竟然等了將近 20 分鐘才上桌，是在現場「熬湯」嗎?\n清炒鮮菇義大利麵 180 元。\n韓式泡菜鍋 320 元，味道一般，有豬肉片，但大部分是火鍋料（魚板、螃蟹棒，都是澱粉製品），只附一碗白飯，就這樣。\n唯一的優點是地點方便，離捷運復興崗站很近，出口右前方即可到達。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Shine Sheu",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113248813762610731563/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW9493kDYKRrl96VMrJ6OaI6LvZzFFnVlynir9-OCMnuO7jIxH7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2026-01-30T03:02:01.384476779Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dE5EVjRjbHA0UkVKNWQzSjJiMHBzU2tzMlJFRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dE5EVjRjbHA0UkVKNWQzSjJiMHBzU2tzMlJFRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442afe321fd967f:0xa0a7e6ad8ff0215f"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJf5b9IeOvQjQRXyHwj63mp6A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGVGMyTjBlRGt0YVdWQlJYTkVkRlZQWHpreWJXYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This restaurant is conveniently located opposite the MRT station. The interior is spacious and fairly comfortable. Although some reviews complained about dust on the chandeliers, I personally didn\u0027t mind; dust is everywhere, and it doesn\u0027t seem to affect the dining experience.\n\nI ordered the shrimp fried rice for NT$100, which was quite good, and the portion size was reasonable for the price.\n\nThe kids each ordered a NT$180 Italian meat sauce pasta dish with NT$50 black tea and NT$50 juice, and they also said it was delicious.\n\nI\u0027ll definitely come again next time.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "20260204這家餐廳就在捷運站對面，還滿方便的，室內空間寬闊，還算舒適，雖然有評論抱怨吊燈有灰塵，但我個人不在意這點，灰塵到處都有，感覺不影響用餐就好。\n我點蝦仁炒飯100元，還不錯吃，份量符合價格。\n孩子們各點一份180元的義大利肉醬麵+紅茶50元、果汁50元，他們也說好吃。\n下次有機會再來了。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Vaster (光點嚮導•等級12)",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118371377595554230333/reviews",
